Description:
 linuxmuster-cli7 - Tools and CLI for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-cli7 (7.4.8) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [schoolclass] Teachers are now written to sophomorixAdmins as well as
     to the member list, which is where sophomorix and the webui read
     them from.
   * [schoolclass] New command to clean up the orphan subgroups left
     behind by a killed schoolclass.
   * [teachers] Ignore the attic group when listing teachers.
   * [students] Ignore the attic for every school.
   * [students] Do not abort on a single failure: every failure is
     collected and displayed, with a non-zero exit code.
   * [samba] Check the given school is a valid one.
   * [help] Update the help of several parameters.
